{
  "id": "liar",
  "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
  "rate": "+0%",
  "title": "Spot the liar: which suspect is lying?",
  "hot": ["lying", "liar", "myths", "away", "fidgeting", "neither", "trick", "backwards", "memory", "cleanly", "built", "slip", "moves", "changes", "b", "drove", "bus", "um", "truth", "nerves", "lies", "200", "fifty-four", "coin", "flip"],
  "lines": [
    {"text": "One of these three is lying about last night. Learn what detectives really look for, then you find the liar.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "SPOT THE LIAR", "note": "",
      "events": [{"cue": "lying", "kind": "lying"}, {"cue": "Learn", "kind": "wipe"}]},
    {"text": "First, the myths. Looking away? Fidgeting? Neither one means lying.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "MYTHS", "note": "",
      "events": [{"cue": "myths", "kind": "myths"}, {"cue": "away", "kind": "gaze"}, {"cue": "Fidgeting", "kind": "fidget"}, {"cue": "Neither", "kind": "myth"}]},
    {"text": "Detectives use a trick. Tell the story again, backwards.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "THE TRICK", "note": "", "pause": 0.2,
      "events": [{"cue": "trick", "kind": "trick"}, {"cue": "backwards", "kind": "back"}]},
    {"text": "The truth is a memory, so it rewinds cleanly.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "THE TRICK", "note": "", "pause": 0.15,
      "events": [{"cue": "memory", "kind": "mem"}, {"cue": "cleanly", "kind": "clean"}]},
    {"text": "A lie was built forwards. Rewind it, and things slip.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "THE TRICK", "note": "", "pause": 0.2,
      "events": [{"cue": "built", "kind": "built"}, {"cue": "slip", "kind": "slip"}]},
    {"text": "Watch for a step that moves, or a detail that changes.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "THE TRICK", "note": "", "pause": 0.2,
      "events": [{"cue": "moves", "kind": "moves"}, {"cue": "changes", "kind": "changes"}]},
    {"text": "Your turn. Who's lying?", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "YOUR TURN", "note": "", "pause": 0.3,
      "events": [{"cue": "turn", "kind": "test"}, {"cue": "lying", "kind": "ask"}]},
    {"text": "B! Forwards, he drove. Backwards, he took the bus.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "THE ANSWER", "note": "", "pause": 10.0,
      "events": [{"cue": "B", "kind": "answer"}, {"cue": "drove", "kind": "drove"}, {"cue": "bus", "kind": "bus"}]},
    {"text": "And A, who kept saying um? Telling the truth.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "THE TWIST", "note": "", "pause": 0.25,
      "events": [{"cue": "um", "kind": "a"}, {"cue": "truth", "kind": "truth"}]},
    {"text": "Nerves aren't lies.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "THE TWIST", "note": "", "pause": 0.15,
      "events": [{"cue": "Nerves", "kind": "nerves"}]},
    {"text": "In over 200 studies, people caught liars fifty-four percent of the time.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "REAL LIFE", "note": "", "pause": 0.3,
      "events": [{"cue": "200", "kind": "studies"}, {"cue": "fifty-four", "kind": "pct"}]},
    {"text": "Basically a coin flip.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "REAL LIFE", "note": "", "pause": 0.2,
      "events": [{"cue": "coin", "kind": "coin"}]}
  ]
}
